    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>Bring In Your Bounty, Dead or Alive</strong></i><br><br><strong>Let the Hunt Begin</strong><br>In this classic third-person action-adventure, you'll become Jango Fett, Prime Clone of the Grand Army of the Republic, hired to capture a deranged Dark Jedi.<br><br><strong>Relive the Timeless Tale </strong><br>Experience the legendary Bounty Hunter fantasy set before the events of  Star Wars: Episode II - Attack of the Clones. Face off against foes and maneuver through acrobatic battles in this adaption optimized for today's consoles and hardware.<br><br><strong>Armed to the Teeth</strong><br>Fight your way through the galaxy\u2019s underbelly, equipped with Dual Blasters, your Flamethrower, Whipcord, and pure Mandalorian Rage.",
